  "interpretation": "The frozen Geneformer checkpoints were pretrained with a self-supervised masked-gene objective on rank-encoded corpora that the official corpus cards describe as unlabeled. GSE289173 was submitted to GEO on 2025-02-10 and made public on 2025-02-12, after both frozen training cutoffs. Its linked article was received on 2024-09-20, accepted on 2025-05-16, and published online on 2025-06-25. The official Genecorpus-104M source table is DOI-level rather than accession-complete and contains no GSE289173, PRJNA1221860, or eventual article DOI 10.1038/s41588-025-02237-8. These facts support target_label_unexposed for the sealed cell-state and eQTL/ieQTL outcomes. The cell-state crosswalk detects declared encoder exposure for GSE136103 and Liver_Atlas in V1 and V2, and GSE185477 in V2. An unmatched source is clean_declared only when its first-public date is after the checkpoint cutoff; unmatched sources already public before a cutoff remain unknown.",
  "remaining_blockers": [
    "Extend the completed cell-state crosswalk to the five-cohort bulk source families and any other task that proposes Geneformer-derived transfer.",
    "Treat development sources found in a pretraining corpus as encoder_seen for source-stratified diagnostics.",
